Subject: [PATCH 4/8] FotaAgent: block Samsung Analytics uploads

---
 .../sdk/samsunganalytics/internal/policy/PolicyClient.smali   | 4 ++++
 .../samsunganalytics/internal/sender/DLS/DLSAPIClient.smali   | 4 ++++
 .../sdk/samsunganalytics/internal/terms/RegisterTask.smali    | 4 ++++
 3 files changed, 12 insertions(+)

diff --git a/smali/com/samsung/context/sdk/samsunganalytics/internal/policy/PolicyClient.smali b/smali/com/samsung/context/sdk/samsunganalytics/internal/policy/PolicyClient.smali
